{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0347-s001", "text": "När du flyttar i Finland från en bostad till en annan:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0347-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.30535888671875, "generation_seconds": 25.446140980813652, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0099-s001", "text": "Kom ihåg att göra flyttanmälan till Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata (Digi- ja väestötietovirasto).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0099-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.588299319727891, "peak": 0.27783203125, "generation_seconds": 36.62575460993685, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0099-s002", "text": "Du kan göra flyttanmälan tidigast en månad före flyttdagen, men den bör göras senast en vecka efter att du har flyttat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0099-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.360748291015625, "generation_seconds": 34.60960247204639, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0099-s003", "text": "Du kan göra anmälan på internet eller med en pappersblankett som du får hos Posti eller vid Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdatas serviceställe.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0099-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.42047119140625, "generation_seconds": 41.115017188945785, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0101-s001", "text": "Om du bor i höghus eller radhus ska du alltid också komma ihåg att meddela husets disponent (isännöitsijä) att du flyttar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0101-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.401214599609375, "generation_seconds": 34.28839581599459, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0102-s001", "text": "Meddela din nya adress till alla instanser som skickar dig post.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0102-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.43511962890625, "generation_seconds": 20.46409881906584, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0102-s002", "text": "Vissa organisationer och företag får din nya adress direkt från befolkningsregistret.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0102-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.732244897959184, "peak": 0.30914306640625, "generation_seconds": 25.493857444031164, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0102-s003", "text": "Du har ändå själv ansvaret för att dina fakturor skickas till rätt adress och betalas i tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0102-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.33734130859375, "generation_seconds": 30.466696779010817, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0103-s001", "text": "I varje husbolag finns det ordningsregler, och alla boende ska följa dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0103-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.317626953125, "generation_seconds": 25.120899794856086, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0103-s002", "text": "Då är det trivsamt och tryggt för alla att bo i huset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0103-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.378082275390625, "generation_seconds": 19.61306588212028, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0103-s003", "text": "Ordningsreglerna finns ofta på husbolagets anslagstavla, eller så har de delats ut på papper till varje bostad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0103-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.31689453125, "generation_seconds": 40.77719368110411, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0103-s004", "text": "Om man inte hittar ordningsreglerna kan man begära att få dem av hyresvärden eller disponenten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0103-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.41943359375, "generation_seconds": 34.83753205696121, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0104-s001", "text": "Reglerna säger när höghusets ytterdörr är öppen och vilken tid det ska vara tyst i huset.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0104-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.341796875, "generation_seconds": 27.408121214946732, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0104-s002", "text": "Reglerna ger också den boende anvisningar för hur husbolagets gemensamma utrymmen, till exempel tvättstugan eller bastun, kan användas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0104-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.493877551020407, "peak": 0.419891357421875, "generation_seconds": 43.975140993949026, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0105-s001", "text": "Då det ska vara tyst i huset får man exempelvis inte spela hög musik eller renovera.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0105-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.345458984375, "generation_seconds": 27.304750110954046, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0105-s002", "text": "Normalt liv, såsom att duscha eller spola i toaletten, är tillåtet också på natten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0105-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.393280029296875, "generation_seconds": 31.669859275920317, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0105-s003", "text": "Om en granne upprepade gånger exempelvis duschar nattetid och ljudet av det är störande, kan man vänligt påpeka det för grannen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0105-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.866938775510205, "peak": 0.3836669921875, "generation_seconds": 40.588056278880686, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0106-s001", "text": "Om en boende bryter mot ordningsreglerna kan hen få en varning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0106-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.266632080078125, "generation_seconds": 22.628407336072996, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0106-s002", "text": "Om det störande beteendet fortsätter kan hyresavtalet för bostaden hävas eller ägarbostaden tas i besittning av husbolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0106-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.65795918367347, "peak": 0.270233154296875, "generation_seconds": 37.1399669458624, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0106-s003", "text": "Då är den boende tvungen att flytta ut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0106-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.3436734693877552, "peak": 0.2587890625, "generation_seconds": 13.402931487187743, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0107-s001", "text": "Att ta hänsyn till grannarna innebär också att var och en ser till att de gemensamma utrymmena är prydliga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0107-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.26849365234375, "generation_seconds": 32.36464232788421, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0107-s002", "text": "Gemensamma utrymmen är platser som alla i huset använder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0107-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.34649658203125, "generation_seconds": 19.605350298807025, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0107-s003", "text": "Det kan vara gården, trappan, tvättstugan och platsen för sopor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0107-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.3704833984375, "generation_seconds": 22.702576169976965, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0107-s004", "text": "På gården slänger alla sina sopor i ett gemensamt sopkärl.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0107-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.337432861328125, "generation_seconds": 19.704554952913895, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0108-s001", "text": "Ibland kan det uppstå meningsskiljaktigheter med grannarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0108-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.296966552734375, "generation_seconds": 18.030143345938995, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0108-s002", "text": "Vanliga orsaker till det är till exempel oväsen från en lägenhet eller rökning på balkongen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0108-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.24560546875, "generation_seconds": 29.025758504867554, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0108-s003", "text": "Det är bra att alltid försöka lösa meningsskiljaktigheter genom att vänligt prata med varandra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0108-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.384307861328125, "generation_seconds": 31.05543768615462, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0108-s004", "text": "Om det inte hjälper att prata kan man kontakta husbolaget och be om hjälp för att lösa tvisten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0108-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.31842041015625, "generation_seconds": 32.18452146300115, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0109-s001", "text": "Om problemen med en granne förvärras och inte heller husbolaget kan lösa frågan, kan grannskapsmedling vara till hjälp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0109-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.25531005859375, "generation_seconds": 33.0103675450664, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0109-s002", "text": "Vid grannskapsmedling hjälper en utomstående, opartisk medlare parterna att hitta lösningar på meningsskiljaktigheterna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0109-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.334320068359375, "generation_seconds": 34.14911149605177, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0110-s001", "text": "Enligt lag får hyresvärdar inte diskriminera någon till exempel på grund av etniskt ursprung, religion, medborgarskap eller handikapp när de väljer hyresgäster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0110-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.583673469387755, "peak": 0.271453857421875, "generation_seconds": 46.2665895158425, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0110-s002", "text": "En privat hyresvärd har rätt att välja hyresgästen till bostaden men utan diskriminering.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0110-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.500335693359375, "generation_seconds": 24.70848370390013, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0110-s003", "text": "Om du misstänker att du har blivit diskriminerad kan du fråga om råd till exempel hos diskrimineringsombudsmannens kundtjänst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0110-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.00625850340136, "peak": 0.255279541015625, "generation_seconds": 35.33571372902952, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0111-s001", "text": "Du har rätt att se bostaden i förväg och bostadsförmedlaren kan inte kräva att få betalt för detta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0111-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.29608154296875, "generation_seconds": 25.635808161925524, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0111-s002", "text": "Om du har problem som rör förmedlingsarvodet kan du kontakta Konsumentrådgivningen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0111-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.383945578231293, "peak": 0.42864990234375, "generation_seconds": 27.34999432391487, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0112-s001", "text": "Oftast betalar hyresvärden förmedlingsarvodet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0112-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.316375732421875, "generation_seconds": 16.621469187783077, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0112-s002", "text": "Du själv betalar förmedlingsarvodet endast om du har ingått ett skriftligt uppdragsavtal med bostadsförmedlaren om att söka en bostad åt dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0112-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.329795918367347, "peak": 0.26806640625, "generation_seconds": 33.12588612898253, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0112-s003", "text": "Om du inte har ingått ett skriftligt uppdragsavtal får bostadsförmedlaren inte kräva dig på förmedlingsarvode.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0112-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.291961669921875, "generation_seconds": 23.988724651979282, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0112-s004", "text": "Om hen försöker göra detta kan du polisanmäla hen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0112-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.238250732421875, "generation_seconds": 13.289240394951776, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0113-s001", "text": "Om du inte har en stadigvarande bostad och inte heller är officiell hyresgäst eller underhyresgäst, är du bostadslös.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0113-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.23748779296875, "generation_seconds": 31.64889804692939, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0113-s002", "text": "I Finland tillhandahåller välfärdsområdena tjänster för bostadslösa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0113-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.324920654296875, "generation_seconds": 17.809561608126387, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0114-s001", "text": "Om du inte har en bostad, ta kontakt med socialservicen (sosiaalipalvelut) i området där du vistas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0114-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.328338623046875, "generation_seconds": 22.645272460067645, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0114-s002", "text": "Kontaktuppgifterna hittar du på välfärdsområdenas webbplatser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0114-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.349334716796875, "generation_seconds": 14.779357469175011, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0114-s003", "text": "Socialservicen hjälper dig när du söker bostad eller tillfällig inkvartering.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0114-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.258056640625, "generation_seconds": 15.167374565964565, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0114-s004", "text": "En tillfällig inkvartering kan vara ett hem för bostadslösa, ett natthärbärge eller en bostad som är avsedd för bostadslösa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-boendeproblem/narration/hb-c11-u0114-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.797278911564625, "peak": 0.3353271484375, "generation_seconds": 27.419871595920995, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
